<title>AUSTRIA: bauMax '96 pretax down, but sees '97 up.</title>
<headline>bauMax '96 pretax down, but sees '97 up.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austria's do-it-yourself chain bauMax AG said on Thursday its provisional group pre-tax profit for 1996 was 6.5 percent lower at 200 million schillings, adding it expected this to improve to 218 million this year.</p>
<p>Group sales rose to 7.177 billion schillings from 6.83 billion in 1995, and are expected to climb to 7.8 billion in 1997, the company said ahead of a news conference.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 253</p>
</text>
